 -> (no matches)","from_env (config.py:448-658) resolves model/provider, budgets (max_tokens/iterations/timeout/retry/tool_timeout), overlap, headers, langfuse, repo/tickets path — but nothing named 'web'","AC 1: 'Table-driven readers for model/provider, budgets, tracing, web, and path settings move out'"],"finding":"The plan enumerates a 'web' reader cluster to extract, but no web-tool parsing exists in LLMConfig.from_env or config.py — the from_env body has no web/web_tool settings, and repo search for 'web'/'web_tool_gating' in the LLM config surface returns no matches. 'web' appears to be a hallucinated/non-existent reader cluster.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff58f6f5b053aab72","impact":0.85,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach + AC line 1 ('model/provider, budgets, tracing, web, and path')","norm_id":"nf28edcf77b81b3e7","priority":0.68,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":true,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Replace 'model/provider, budgets, tracing, web, and path settings' with the clusters that actually exist in from_env, or add a Context note if a web reader is expected to be created (which would be CREATION = out-of-scope).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["3 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable)."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Specify that the bedrock_region_name / bedrock_region_source pair stays produced by the single `_llm_str_source` pass inside whichever assembler owns it, so the source label cannot be re-derived and diverge from the value (cda8).","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.501,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["config.py:510-512 resolves the pair from one call: `bedrock_region_name, bedrock_region_source = _llm_str_source(table, cli, \"REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION\", \"bedrock_region_name\", None)`","config.py:381-386 docstring: bedrock_region_source is 'Set by `from_env` from the SAME resolution pass that produced the value (never re-derived)'","config_readers.py:70-72 states the source 'from the SAME pass that produced the value ... can never diverge from the resolution (cda8)'"],"finding":"The plan's 'cohesive helper assemblers for the current field groups' framing does not call out that bedrock_region_name and bedrock_region_source MUST remain produced by a SINGLE _llm_str_source pass — the cda8 invariant that the provenance label can never diverge from the value it labels. A naive field-group split (a 'string knobs' assembler + a 'provenance' assembler) could re-derive the source separately and reintroduce the drift cda8 fixed.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f51ecace0889aa338","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / Acceptance Criteria (AC1)","norm_id":"n0f3bddfc69ed679b","priority":0.099,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An assembler for string knobs returns bedrock_region_name while a separate concern recomputes the source label, and the two disagree when a lower layer wins"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Note that the overlap-group assembler must preserve the `_llm_drain_mode(_llm_str(...))` wrapping for overlap_drain (enum validation + default fallback), not treat it as a plain reader.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.501,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["config.